@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8765

### Current projects folder (source: default | config | app) and the progress of a move in flight.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/projects-dir

### Preview: what "move all" would carry over, size, same drive or not, free space and problems. Changes nothing.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/projects-dir/plan
X-VideoCreator: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"path":"D:\\Videos\\VideoCreator","move":true}

### Change and move everything in the current folder (paths stored in the app are re-rooted).
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/projects-dir
X-VideoCreator: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"path":"D:\\Videos\\VideoCreator","move":true}

### Change without moving: new projects go to the new folder, existing ones stay where they are.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/projects-dir
X-VideoCreator: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"path":"D:\\Videos\\VideoCreator","move":false}

### Validation error (422): a relative path.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/projects-dir
X-VideoCreator: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"path":"Videos","move":true}
